#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:5
msgid "Polygon"
msgstr "多边形"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:8
msgid "Create polygon"
msgstr "创建多边形"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:12
msgid ""
"To draw more easily, the folio grid can be displayed from **Display > "
"Display the grid** or from `toolbar`_ icon |grid|."
msgstr ""
"为了更方便地绘制，可以通过 **Display > Display the grid** 或 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 上的 |grid| "
"图标显示图幅网格。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:21
msgid "grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:15
msgid "The polygon can only be added to the `workspace`_ by `toolbar`_."
msgstr "多边形只能通过 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 添加到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:17
msgid "Select the icon |polygon| from the `toolbar`_ to add a polygon."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择 |polygon| 图标以添加多边形。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:22
msgid "polygon"
msgstr "多边形"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:18
msgid ""
"Draw connected lines by simple click on the beginning and end point from "
"each line."
msgstr "依次单击每条线的起点和终点，即可绘制相连的线条。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:19
msgid "Double Click on the end vertex/point from the polygon."
msgstr "双击多边形的末端顶点/点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:26
msgid ""
"During the polygon creation, the previous line can be deleted without "
"stopping the creation process."
msgstr "创建多边形时，可以删除上一条线，而不会中断创建过程。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:29
msgid ""
"Right click will delete the previous line without losing all previous work."
msgstr "右键单击会删除上一条线，而不会丢失之前的所有工作。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Add**."
msgstr "如果未显示 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ ，可以从 **Settings > Display > Add** 中将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:36
msgid "Polygon properties"
msgstr "多边形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:38
msgid ""
"A polygon is a plane figure generated by a finite number of line segments "
"connected. When the initial and end line segments from the polygon are "
"connected, the polygon defines a closed area."
msgstr "多边形是由有限数量的线段连接而成的平面图形。当多边形的首尾线段相连时，多边形便围成一个封闭区域。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:41
msgid ""
"When the polygon do not define a closed area, the properties from the "
"polygon object are the same as a `line object`_."
msgstr "当多边形未围成封闭区域时，多边形对象的属性与 `线条对象 <line object_>`_ 相同。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:43
msgid ""
"When the polygon defines a closed area, the **Closed polygon** check button "
"from the polygon properties panel is selected, the polygon object has the "
"same properties as a `rectangle object`_."
msgstr ""
"当多边形围成封闭区域，并且选中了多边形属性面板中的 **Closed polygon** 复选框时，多边形对象具有与 `矩形对象 <rectangle "
"object_>`_ 相同的属性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:48
msgid ""
"If the initial and the end line segments from the polygon are not connected "
"when the **Closed polygon** check button is selected, a new line segment "
"which connects both segments will be automatically generated."
msgstr "如果选中 **Closed polygon** 复选框时多边形的首尾线段尚未相连，则会自动生成一条连接这两段的线段。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:51
msgid ""
"The polygon properties can be displayed from `menu bar`_, by right click on "
"one polygon edge/line, from selection properties panel and using keyboard "
"shortcut."
msgstr "多边形属性可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 、右键单击多边形的某条边/线、选择属性面板以及键盘快捷键来显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:55
msgid "Polygon properties from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏显示多边形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:57
#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:95
msgid "Select one of the edges/lines from the polygon which should be edited."
msgstr "选择要编辑的多边形边/线之一。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:58
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit the selected object** menu item to display the polygon "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > Edit the selected object** 菜单项，以显示多边形属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:63
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:66
msgid "Polygon properties by right click"
msgstr "通过右键单击显示多边形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:68
msgid ""
"Right click on one of the edges/lines from the polygon which should be "
"edited."
msgstr "右键单击要编辑的多边形边/线之一。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:69
msgid ""
"Select the option **Edit the selected object** to display the polygon "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit the selected object** 选项，以显示多边形属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:74
#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:111
#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:122
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech polygon selection PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 多边形选择弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:77
msgid "Polygon properties from selection properties panel"
msgstr "从选择属性面板显示多边形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:79
msgid ""
"Select one of the edges/lines from the polygon which should be edited and "
"the properties from the polygon will appear at `selection properties "
"panel`_."
msgstr "选择要编辑的多边形边/线之一，多边形属性将显示在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 中。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:84
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Polygon properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 多边形属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**"
msgstr ""
"如果未显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ ，可以从 **Settings > Display > "
"Selection properties** 中将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:91
msgid "Polygon properties using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键显示多边形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:93
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:96
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the polygon properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示多边形属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:100
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:103
msgid "Add new point to polygon"
msgstr "向多边形添加新点"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:105
msgid ""
"Right click on the place from the edges/lines of the polygon where the new "
"point should be created."
msgstr "在多边形边/线上要创建新点的位置右键单击。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:106
msgid ""
"Select the option **Add a point** to create the new point at the polygon."
msgstr "选择 **Add a point** 选项，在多边形上创建新点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:114
msgid "Delete point to polygon"
msgstr "删除多边形上的点"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:116
msgid "Right click on the point from the polygon which should be deleted."
msgstr "右键单击要删除的多边形顶点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/polygon.rst:117
msgid ""
"Select the option **Delete this point** to delete the point from the "
"polygon."
msgstr "选择 **Delete this point** 选项，从多边形中删除该点。"
